<title>UK: NatWest millenium costs up to 100 mln stg.</title>
<headline>NatWest millenium costs up to 100 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Westminster Bank Plc said on Tuesday it expected the cost of making its computer systems &quot;Millennium-compliant&quot; at as much as 100 million stg over the next couple of years.</p>
<p>&quot;It's designed to make sure that our computers don't find any problems,&quot; Wanless said at a press briefing.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8864.</p>
